  "body": "### What problem are you trying to solve?\n\nSeeing as this event is fired even when the bfcache is used, doesn't it make sense for the event to have a `.persisted` property? [Suggested here](https://github.com/whatwg/html/issues/9315#issuecomment-1680438367).\r\nThe spec and the Chrome implementation does not include this. \n\n### What solutions exist today?\n\n_No response_\n\n### How would you solve it?\n\n_No response_\n\n### Anything else?\n\n_No response_",
